@startuml uc-inspect-capabilities
!include _theme.iuml

state inspectCapabilities as "inspectCapabilities()" {

  state " " as RequestingEvidence
  state " " as Resolving
  state " " as Presenting

  [*] --> RequestingEvidence
  note on link
  <b>Operator</b> asks what Octoform believes each selected
  account supports, before planning against it
  end note

  RequestingEvidence --> Resolving
  note on link
  <b>Octoform</b> asks GitHub, because that is where the
  evidence is, and resolves each account by login
  end note

  Resolving --> Presenting
  note on link
  <b>Octoform</b> reports evidence rather than assumption
  • the account kind, resolved from the API
  • the numeric identity, stable across renames
  • whether organisation-wide rulesets are available
  • every declaration that does not apply to this kind
    of account, with the reason it does not
  end note

  Presenting --> [*]
  note on link
  <b>Operator</b> corrects the declaration or accepts that
  it will be reported on every run
  end note
}

inspectCapabilities --> CAPABILITIES_ESTABLISHED
note on link
exit 0
end note

inspectCapabilities -[#A78BFA]-> CONFIGURATION_RESOLVED
note on link
the token cannot authenticate; exit 3
end note
@enduml
